        an older version of main -- the `reset --soft` squash onto a moved main. `git revert` commits are exempt
        for the files of the commit they revert.
  agentctl cleanup [--dry-run|--execute] [--repo PATH ...] [--no-fetch] [--no-remote] [--min-age-hours H]
